            }
          ],
          "derivation": "Complex conjugation of paths conjugates the integral of the real differential. This proves equivariance; the trivial action on E[2] then forces (J-1)Lambda subset2Lambda and gives integral projectors. Neither equivariance nor integral splitting is attributed to a rational eigenbasis alone.",
          "boundary": "General complex uniformization is used; no CM hypothesis or CM-specific model is imported."
        }
